id: STYLE-031
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Inconsistent naming convention (mixed camelCase/snake_case)
category: style
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: (const|let|var)\s+[a-z]+_[a-z]+\w*\s*=
    message: "snake_case variable in JavaScript/TypeScript — convention is camelCase"
fix: Use camelCase for JS/TS variables and functions. snake_case is for Python/Ruby.
